{
  "id": "2CO.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "2CO",
  "reference": "2 Korintos 11",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waxyaalo uu Bawlos Xaq u Lahaa Rasuulnimadiisii Aawadeed",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan jeclaan lahaa inaad iigu dulqaadataan doqonnimadayda yar. Laakiin waad ii dulqaadataan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan idiinku masayrsanahay masayr xagga Ilaah ah, waayo, waxaan idiin guuriyey nin keliya, inaan idiin dhiibo Masiix idinkoo ah bikrad daahir ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin waxaan ka baqayaa in maankiinna laga halleeyo lillaahinimada iyo daahirnimada xagga Masiix, sidii abeesadii xeeladdeedii Xaawa ugu khiyaanaysay oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, haddii mid yimaado oo idinku wacdiyo Ciise kale oo ah ku aanan ku wacdiyin, ama haddii aad heshaan ruux ka duwan kii aad hesheen, ama injiil ka duwan kii aad aqbasheen, si wanaagsan ayaad ugu dulqaadataan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan u malaynayaa inaanan sina uga liidan rasuulladaas ugu waaweyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin in kastoo aanan hadalka ku fiicnayn, aqoonta waan ku fiicanahay, oo taasaannu si kasta idiinku muujinnay dadka oo dhan hortiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dembi miyaan falay markaan is-hoosaysiiyey in idinka laydin sarraysiiyo, maxaa yeelay, injiilka Ilaah ayaan idinku wacdiyey hadiyad ahaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiniisado kale ayaan dhacay, anigoo mushahaaro ka qaadaya, si aan idiinku adeego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaan idinla joogay oo aan wax u baahnaa, ninna culays kuma aan hayn, waayo, walaalihii markay Makedoniya ka yimaadeen waxay ii dhammaystireen waxaan u baahnaa, oo si kastana waan isu celiyey si aanan idiin culaysin, waanan isa sii celin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sida Masiixa runtiisu ay iigu jirto, faankan laygama joojin doono xagga dalalka Akhaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo? Ma waxay tahay inaanan idin jeclayn? Ilaah baa garan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin waxaan samaynayo, waan sii samayn doonaa, inaan ka gooyo waxay kuwa doonaya inay wax ku faanaan ku faani lahaayeen, in waxay ku faanaan loo garto inay sidayada oo kale yihiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwaas oo kale waa rasuullo been ah iyo shaqeeyayaal khaa'inno ah iyagoo isu ekaysiinaya rasuullada Masiix. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo layaabna ma leh, waayo, Shaydaanka qudhiisu wuxuu isu ekaysiiyaa malaa'igta iftiinka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba wax weyn ma aha haddii ay midiidinyadiisuna isu ekaysiiyaan midiidinyada xaqnimada, iyagoo dhammaanshahoodu u ahaan doono sida shuqulladooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bawlos oo ku Dhibaatooday Rasuulnimadiisii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddana waxaan leeyahay, Qofna yaanu doqon ii malayn, laakiin haddaad ii malaysaan, weliba sida doqon ii qaata inaan aniguna in yar faano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan ku hadlayo ugu hadli maayo sida Rabbigu doonayo, laakiin si doqonnimo ah iyo si geesinimadan faanka ah ayaan ugu hadlayaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siday kuwa badanu jidhka ugu faanaan, ayaan anna ugu faani doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, idinku si farxadleh ayaad doqonnada ugu dulqaadataan idinkoo caqli leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idinku waad u dulqaadataan nin hadduu idin addoonsado, hadduu wixiinna cuno, hadduu wax idinka qaato, hadduu isa sarraysiiyo, hadduu wejiga idinka dharbaaxo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan ka xishoonayaa inaan idhaahdo, Waannu tabardaran nahay. Laakiin weliba wax kasta oo uu qof geesi ku yahay, aniguna geesi baan ku ahay (sida doqon ayaan u hadlayaa). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyagu ma Cibraaniyo baa? Anna waan ahay. Ma reer binu Israa'iil baa? Anna waan ahay. Ma dhashii Ibraahim baa? Anna waan ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyagu ma Masiix bay u adeegaan? Si ka sii badan ayaan ugu adeegaa. Sidii qof waalan ayaan u hadlayaa. Waan ka hawlo badnaa, waanan ka xabsi badnaa, karbaashyo tirola'aan ahna waa laygu dhuftay, marar badanna dhimashaan ku dhowaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shan goor Yuhuuddu waxay i karbaasheen afartan mid la'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saddex goorna ulaa laygu dhuftay, marna waa lay dhagxiyey, saddex goor doonni baa ila jabtay, habeen iyo maalinna waxaan ku jiray badda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marar badan baan safray, xagga webiyadana khatar baan galay, xagga tuugaggana khatar baan galay, xagga dadkaygana khatar baan galay, xagga dadka aan Yuhuuddu ahaynna khatar baan galay, xagga magaaladana khatar baan galay, xagga cidladana khatar baan galay, xagga baddana khatar baan galay, walaalo been ah dhexdoodana khatar baan ku galay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaanna ku jiray dhib iyo daal, marar badanna hurdola'aan iyo gaajo iyo harraad, marar badanna cuntola'aan iyo qabow iyo arrad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxyaalahaas dibadda ahna waxaa ii dheeraad ah waxaa maalin walba i dhiba ee ah kawelwelidda kiniisadaha oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumaa itaaldaran oo anna aanan itaal darnayn? Kumaa la xumeeyey oo aanan ka guban? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadday tahay inaan faano waxaan ku faanayaa waxyaalaha ku saabsan itaaldarradayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaaha ah Aabbaha Rabbi Ciise, kan barakada leh weligiis, wuxuu yaqaan inaanan been sheegaynin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
